<urn:atm:triage:finding/AZS4-QA-013>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AZS4-QA-013" ;
  triage:title "await_release_handles' bounded-join timeout branch has no test forcing it to fire" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr's QA-4 verdict reports this gap from two independent reviewers (rust-qa-agent's QA-001, and rust-service-hardening-agent's RSH-005, same underlying gap): the new bounded-join timeout arm added at crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:192 in await_release_handles (tokio::time::timeout(HERDR_REQUEST_DEADLINE, handle).await, added under AZS4-QA-011's fix) has no test that actually forces the timeout branch (Err(_) arm) to fire -- only the happy-path Ok(Ok(())) join is exercised by ac11_claim_drop_guard_release_is_joined_before_pump_shutdown. Without a test that drives a release job past HERDR_REQUEST_DEADLINE, a future regression that removes or shortens the bound would not be caught." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-az" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-coverage" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
